{"title":"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_20\">Problem 20</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 20\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the average value of the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/6/226d677bb39aeae40fdaea73609421245ec2ec60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = x\\sqrt{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"97\" height=\"22\" /> on the interval <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/1/fc1a4b92145593b2657b4b96878d84ea22c611f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[0,4]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"38\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/0/b90add1170c0aed2f92519a0a77d92eecb884eea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\dfrac{13}{4}  \\quad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\dfrac{19}{6}  \\quad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{16}{5}  \\quad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\dfrac{10}{3}  \\quad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"337\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the average value formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/1/031a140e6c37079a7220c617df048c3625996cb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{b-a} \\int_a^b f(x)\\, dx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"134\" height=\"46\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/c/69cefa6855d2216036df094012f7ad2a7e4e204f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/a/fda5328bc4703ff88e62aa83ea58ae4e8361f5ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/f/b1f22ac8374c539840555e4abd0ed55c23475f9b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{1}{4-0} \\int_{0}^{4} x\\sqrt{x} \\, dx = \\frac{1}{4} \\int_{0}^{4} x^{ \\frac{3}{2} } \\, dx = \\frac{1}{4} \\left[ \\frac{2}{5} x^{ \\frac{5}{2} } \\right]^{4}_{0} = \\frac{1}{4} \\cdot \\frac{2}{5} \\left( 4^{ \\frac{5}{2} } - 0^{ \\frac{5}{2} }\\right) = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\dfrac{16}{5}}.\\]\" width=\"581\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>~Blosp\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest\">2026 TMTA Calculus</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_School_Calculus_Contest_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_TMTA_High_Scho